---
// src/components/sections/CalibrationSection.astro
---

<section class="section-surface calibration">
    <div class="calibration__header">
      <p>Calibración / V1</p>
      <p>Señal → Contexto</p>
    </div>
  
    <div class="calibration__content">
      <div class="calibration__intro">
        <h2>Medir no es entender.</h2>
  
        <p>
          El sensor entrega una lectura cruda. Para convertirla en humedad útil,
          primero necesitamos conocer cómo responde en nuestra propia tierra.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="calibration__model">
        <div class="calibration__reference">
          <span>01</span>
  
          <div>
            <p>Referencia seca</p>
            <p>Valor observado cuando la tierra necesita agua.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
  
        <div class="calibration__reference">
          <span>02</span>
  
          <div>
            <p>Referencia húmeda</p>
            <p>Valor observado después de alcanzar una humedad adecuada.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
  
        <div class="calibration__result">
          <span>Resultado</span>
          <p>Lectura cruda → porcentaje → estado</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <style>
    .calibration {
      background: var(--color-clay-bg);
      color: var(--color-clay);
    }
  
    .calibration__header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  
    .calibration__header p {
      margin: 0;
  
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
  
    .calibration__content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(22rem, 1fr);
      align-items: end;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  
    .calibration__intro h2 {
      max-width: 8ch;
      margin: 0;
  
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 0.88;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }
  
    .calibration__intro > p {
      max-width: 28rem;
      margin: 2rem 0 0;
  
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  
    .calibration__model {
      border-top: 1px dashed currentColor;
    }
  
    .calibration__reference {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
  
      padding: 1.25rem 0;
  
      border-bottom: 1px dashed currentColor;
    }
  
    .calibration__reference span {
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
  
    .calibration__reference p {
      margin: 0;
    }
  
    .calibration__reference p:first-child {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
  
    .calibration__reference p:last-child {
      max-width: 26rem;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
  
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  
    .calibration__result {
      padding: 2rem 0 0;
    }
  
    .calibration__result span {
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
  
    .calibration__result p {
      max-width: 14ch;
      margin: 1rem 0 0;
  
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 0.9;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 48rem) {
      .calibration__header {
        gap: 1rem;
      }
  
      .calibration__content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        align-content: end;
        gap: 3rem;
      }
  
      .calibration__intro {
        padding-top: 2rem;
      }
  
      .calibration__intro h2 {
        max-width: 7ch;
        font-size: clamp(3.75rem, 17vw, 6rem);
      }
  
      .calibration__reference {
        grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>